From b7fca79f82d53f3d273b1e072c44628bdd53c947 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Mon, 21 Sep 2026 17:22:11 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] fix(ingest): tighten Hermes admission binding and safety
 regressions

Align the shared local_model_admission_v1 fixture with PR #75 structured
accepted reports, recompute evidence digests, cross-bind runtime/provider/
model fields to the manifest, require isolated workspaces and external
verifiers, carry repository revisions in execution_provenance, and extend
secret, hidden-reasoning, URL, trajectory-id, and tool-payload fail-closed
checks with focused regressions.
